{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2023-05-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL SIGNS INDUSTRY-FIRST STRATEGIC COLLABORATION WITH RAPPI, INC. IN LATIN AMERICA', 'text': 'COMPANIES JOIN FORCES TO OFFER MORE CHOICE FOR MEMBERS PLANTATION, FLA. , MAY 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL (NASDAQ: MAR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED AN INDUSTRY-FIRST AGREEMENT WITH RAPPI, INC., THE MULTILATINA TECHNOLOGY COMPANY.'}